<title>CANADA: Westburne Inc Q3 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Westburne Inc Q3 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr   Profit	    C$0.28  Profit	 C$0.23</p>
<p> Net   Profit	    21,025  Profit	 20,950</p>
<p> Revs		     559,646		  556,701</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr  Loss		 C$3.24   Profit	C$0.42</p>
<p> Net  Loss		152,766   Profit	19,755</p>
<p> Revs		   1,535,420		1,571,133</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Note: Net earnings in latest nine-month period before special writedown of goodwill and future tax benefits were C$24.9 million or C$0.52 a share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
